{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>流浮山雞伯嶺路一個貨倉，今日（17日）下午1時15分發生火警。火勢猛烈，並冒出大量濃煙。消防處接報列三級火警，現場貨倉面積50米乘30米，出動四條喉及四隊煙帽隊灌救，並派出兩輛救護車戒備，暫時未有受傷報告。</p><p>消防處稱，下午1時15分接獲報告指流浮山鳳降村一個貨倉發生火警，並於下午1時29分將火警升為三級，現正進行滅火行動；呼籲市民如受到隨風飄散的煙霧和異味影響，請關閉門窗及保持鎮定。</p><figure><img alt=\"消防員在場灌救。（讀者提供）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260917/1177256009824342016134982.jpeg/sKmcgjNkIKWn4MJ0jn1kJmF4gjEuycFeFYOSPBWDkjw\"/><figcaption>消防員在場灌救。（讀者提供）</figcaption></figure><p>《香港01》接獲讀者提供的片段，據報現場是物流倉，可見貨倉內及對開空地均有大火，冒出大量濃煙。暫時未知起火原因，貨倉內不多人，附近幾十人自行疏散。</p><figure><img alt=\"消防員在場灌救。（讀者提供）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260917/1177256007630589952824651.jpeg/AIdEf9Ri2KQTcMEdRTdrkyMRQvSmvOJpDdePdg3Xj3Y\"/><figcaption>消防員在場灌救。（讀者提供）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場火光熊熊冒出濃煙。（讀者提供）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260917/1177256005394894848516874.jpeg/fqYfELuAWKwn96nwlsC4xNv_FTmLwtJMmWaQKplmkCo\"/><figcaption>現場火光熊熊冒出濃煙。（讀者提供）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場火光熊熊冒出濃煙。（讀者提供）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260917/1177256002991427584176892.jpeg/F8Fra7rlPWgqMGaLnd706y1TGYqwGwXDXizGpF4sxqQ\"/><figcaption>現場火光熊熊冒出濃煙。（讀者提供）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防員用航拍機視察火場情況。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260917/1177264480267014144578429.jpeg/3JdlQWuXhdl4fwhIOkzI1fa4cvHs_URndlZO1VNWTtU\"/><figcaption>消防員用航拍機視察火場情況。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防流動指揮車亦到場。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260917/1177264850888298496657134.jpeg/p5UD2gALPW3BAJmEJNH9egnUFw57xeRgDywddSosHXU\"/><figcaption>消防流動指揮車亦到場。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防處將火警列三級，煙火特遣隊到場。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260917/1177268444295335936839701.jpeg/Eu3gZl3Zl52cM4qENSbYmV4pOdeb27NGEIdwBhCHcAY\"/><figcaption>消防處將火警列三級，煙火特遣隊到場。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防處列三級火救援。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260917/1177264967502532608741628.jpeg/hMrN0UhDURLrDdb2sQd3CcLBYX97--Nf2pPGi_-Txos\"/><figcaption>消防處列三級火救援。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防員用航拍機視察火場情況。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260917/1177265299058069504627913.jpeg/Kxxv4A4YFR-MQP3PmqUBehexiAFWUWEiG6Qqfj6kKn4\"/><figcaption>消防員用航拍機視察火場情況。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防員用航拍機視察火場情況。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260917/1177265302371700736378120.jpeg/v-Uu_Sf9vlU3LtPGcWYQug0gCGFXkRpuhDFkJaExZCU\"/><figcaption>消防員用航拍機視察火場情況。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防流動指揮車亦到場。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260917/1177265305282678784427810.jpeg/zrCl_Tm7VAlqFD8i8LEQ0069GdyFV7W16C4iIs0uIiI\"/><figcaption>消防流動指揮車亦到場。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防流動指揮車亦到場。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260917/1177265308185268224248690.jpeg/JDz3A5cxnqFCuhAW3mWzWTsf9-SIymWym671sb6u9bE\"/><figcaption>消防流動指揮車亦到場。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防處列三級火救援。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260917/1177265311364681728718536.jpeg/n3VdXKwafno37s8hfE5UjlG2hhAbccexNbu5cRC7uXE\"/><figcaption>消防處列三級火救援。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防處列三級火救援。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260917/1177265279294509056594360.jpeg/A7KbAazr6Di_kQaCsnv_6SoL-MT69Yu5eghV5l8IVeY\"/><figcaption>消防處列三級火救援。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-17T06:59:56.174971+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":526,"images":14,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}